---
subject = "{{ inviter }} would like you in {{ organization }}"
---
{% comment %}
  Overrides the framework's invitation message; the flow around it is
  untouched. It is the only one given `organization` and `inviter`. `inviter`
  is empty when the invite has no name, so the greeting reads either way.
{% endcomment %}
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>{{ app_name }}</title></head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f4f5f7;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1a1c1f;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%" style="background:#f4f5f7;">
<tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="600" style="width:100%;max-width:600px;background:#ffffff;border-radius:14px;border:1px solid #e3e6ea;overflow:hidden;">

<tr><td style="padding:22px 32px;background:#14161a;">
{% if logo_url != '' %}<img src="{{ logo_url }}" alt="{{ app_name }}" height="28" style="display:block;border:0;height:28px;width:auto;">
{% else %}<span style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#ffffff;">{{ app_name }}</span>{% endif %}
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:32px 32px 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;">
{% if inviter != '' %}{{ inviter }} would like you in <strong>{{ organization }}</strong>.{% else %}You have been asked to join <strong>{{ organization }}</strong>.{% endif %}
Accepting sets a password and puts you inside; there is nothing to sign up for first.
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:20px 32px 8px;">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"><tr><td style="border-radius:8px;background:#14161a;">
<a href="{{ url }}" style="display:inline-block;padding:13px 26px;border-radius:8px;color:#ffffff;text-decoration:none;font-size:15px;font-weight:600;line-height:1;">Join {{ organization }}</a>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 0;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
Or paste this into your browser: <a href="{{ url }}" style="color:#4b5563;">{{ url }}</a>
</td></tr>

<tr><td style="padding:16px 32px 28px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;color:#6b7280;">
The invitation stops working in {{ expires_in }}. If you weren't expecting it, ignore this message; nothing happens until the link is used.
</td></tr>

</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
</body></html>
